  "scope": "Fresh isolated process. Warm recognition excludes extraction/OCR and pre-extraction field enumeration; includes per-request text fingerprints and lazy visual rendering. No input features retained across timed requests. Fixed51 uses the same 35 synthetic+16 official inputs as R7; scan group uses fixed sorted historical scans. Component probes are non-additive, outside the latency measure; OCR e2e is reported from evaluation raw, separately. Round9 additionally measures two historical images wrapped in PDFs using their already available OCR text; OCR extraction timing is separate, before warm timing. No v5 evaluation identities selected. Unchanged R9 measurement protocol rerun for R10; no scoring/threshold/engine optimization."
